#
# Counter-example for math:LieStructureShape: a math:LieGroup that omits its
# math:hasRootSystem (sh:minCount 1), so validation MUST emit
# shacl.MinCountConstraintComponent (and no other finding).
# Bound by tests/example-conformance.ttl (ex:ecLieMissingRootSystem).
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/> .

ex:rootlessLieGroup a math:LieGroup .
